  "chain": "undetermined cause [TBD] -> MFP 1A fails to trip remotely -> MFP 1A fails to trip locally -> one of two ESFAS Function 6.g trip inputs unavailable -> ESFAS instrumentation input inoperable (~18 min) [operators manually tripped MFP 1A via steam supply valve closure and manual oil pressure lowering; MDAFWPs manually started]",
  "golden_questions": [
