  ],
  "notes": "No component failure was identified despite extensive inspection/teardown; cause code officially TBD/provisional per form fields, so category set to 'provisional' verbatim. Failure involved a non-safety trip oil system whose loss of pressure input affected the safety-related ESFAS 2-of-2 logic (Function 6.g), triggering the (a)(2)(vii) common-cause reporting criterion; evaluated as not meeting SSFF definition under (a)(2)(v). No previous similar events reported (none to link via SIMILAR_TO)."
